<title>FINLAND: Neste Jan-April net sales by division.</title>
<headline>Neste Jan-April net sales by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish oil, chemicals and energy group Neste Oy on Wednesday gave the following net sales breakdown by division (million markka):</p>
<p>					     Jan-April     Jan-April '96</p>
<p> Oil 1)				     11,929	  11,846</p>
<p> Exploration and production		391	     370</p>
<p> Energy					1,327	   1,191</p>
<p> Chemicals				   1,511	   1,453</p>
<p> Others					  165	     168</p>
<p> TOTAL					15,323	  15,028</p>
<p> Internal sales			     -634	    -618</p>
<p>@</p>
<p> Net sales				  14,689	  14,410</p>
<p>1) Includes trading</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
